  "title": "Limiting power consumption?",
  "body": "I notice my orbic doesnt last especially long on battery (although most of this time ive had the stock sim card in it and it hasnt been connected to service, so maybe its advertising constantly)\r\n\r\n\r\nCurious if theres anything I can do through the root shell or rayhunter settings to disable unnecessary features and reduce power consumption",
